Subject: [PATCH 47/47] fix(Raid/Yogg): Spread influence targets across damage
 dealers

Keep a bounded GUID-only preference per portal wave so melee bots do not walk together to the same influence target while others remain untouched. Claimed targets remain valid fallbacks; gaze, path, sanity and exit budgets are unchanged.
